   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>correctReads.R, as it is without modification, will not work with exome data because the <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">correctReadDepth</font> function call does not use the <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">targetedSequence</font> argument.  You will need to modify it as you have done in your original post. </div><div><br></div><div>What version of TitanCNA are you using?</div><div>If you would like to debug your particular wig files and exon targets, you can access the code <a href=\"https://github.com/gavinha/TitanCNA/blob/master/R/utils.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/gavinha/TitanCNA/blob/master/R/utils.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235445995000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QFyOb1DmiRFwMLou4WPby\">https://github.com/gavinha/TitanCNA/blob/master/R/utils.R</a> under function<br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><table style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-collapse:collapse;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;word-wrap:normal;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(121,93,163)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">correctReadDepth</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">tumWig</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">normWig</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">gcWig</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mapWig</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> genomeStyle </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;NCBI&quot;</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> targetedSequence </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></code></div><br></div><div>You can directly source this function and use the R debugging feature or simply go through each line of code in this function until you encounter the error.</div><div><br></div><div>Hope this helps.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Gavin</div></div>"
